flowchart TD
    Start([Start: ProcessVideo]) --> CheckEnv{Environment<br/>Check}
    CheckEnv -->|Not in sam3 env| Warn[Warn user]
    Warn --> CheckEnv
    CheckEnv -->|OK| InitSAM3[Initialize SAM 3<br/>Predictor]
    
    InitSAM3 -->|Error| Error1[Print error<br/>Exit]
    InitSAM3 -->|Success| InitVLM[Initialize<br/>PhysicsEstimator]
    
    InitVLM -->|Error| Error2[Print error<br/>Exit]
    InitVLM -->|Success| LoadVideo[Load Video<br/>with OpenCV]
    
    LoadVideo -->|Error| Error3[Print error<br/>Exit]
    LoadVideo -->|Success| GetProps[Get Video Properties<br/>FPS, dimensions, frames]
    
    GetProps --> DetectHands[Multi-Object Detection:<br/>Detect Hands]
    
    DetectHands --> StartSession1[Start SAM 3 Session 1]
    StartSession1 --> AddPrompt1[Add Prompt: 'hand'<br/>on frame 0]
    AddPrompt1 --> Propagate1[Propagate through video]
    
    Propagate1 --> Loop1{More frames?}
    Loop1 -->|Yes| ExtractMask1[Extract primary mask<br/>for frame]
    ExtractMask1 --> StoreHand1[Store in<br/>hands_masks dict]
    StoreHand1 --> Loop1
    Loop1 -->|No| CloseSession1[Close Session 1]
    
    CloseSession1 --> DetectObject[Multi-Object Detection:<br/>Detect Target Object]
    
    DetectObject --> StartSession2[Start SAM 3 Session 2]
    StartSession2 --> AddPrompt2[Add Prompt: object_prompt<br/>on frame 0]
    AddPrompt2 --> Propagate2[Propagate through video]
    
    Propagate2 --> Loop2{More frames?}
    Loop2 -->|Yes| ExtractMask2[Extract primary mask<br/>for frame]
    ExtractMask2 --> StoreObj2[Store in<br/>object_masks dict]
    StoreObj2 --> Loop2
    Loop2 -->|No| CloseSession2[Close Session 2]
    
    CloseSession2 --> InitWriter{Output path<br/>specified?}
    InitWriter -->|Yes| CreateWriter[Create VideoWriter]
    InitWriter -->|No| FrameLoop
    CreateWriter --> FrameLoop
    
    FrameLoop[Frame Processing Loop] --> ReadFrame[Read frame<br/>from video]
    ReadFrame --> CheckFrame{Frame<br/>valid?}
    CheckFrame -->|No| EndLoop[End of video]
    CheckFrame -->|Yes| GetMasks[Get masks for<br/>current frame]
    
    GetMasks --> CheckMask{Mask<br/>available?}
    CheckMask -->|No| Visualize
    CheckMask -->|Yes| CheckVLMInterval{VLM interval<br/>reached?}
    
    CheckVLMInterval -->|Yes| ApplyNegMask[Apply negative<br/>masking]
    ApplyNegMask --> RunVLM[Run VLM Analysis]
    RunVLM --> VLMInit{VLM<br/>initialized?}
    VLMInit -->|Yes| QueryVLM[Query Moondream2]
    VLMInit -->|No| Placeholder[Use placeholder<br/>analysis]
    QueryVLM --> CacheResult[Cache VLM result]
    Placeholder --> CacheResult
    CacheResult --> Visualize
    
    CheckVLMInterval -->|No| UseCached[Use cached<br/>VLM result]
    UseCached --> Visualize
    
    Visualize[Visualization] --> ApplyColorMasks[Apply color masks<br/>hands: cyan, object: green]
    ApplyColorMasks --> DrawContours[Draw contours]
    DrawContours --> DrawWireframe[Draw 2D wireframes]
    DrawWireframe --> DrawHUD[Draw AR HUD overlays]
    DrawHUD --> CheckDisplay{Display<br/>enabled?}
    
    CheckDisplay -->|Yes| ShowFrame[Display frame<br/>with cv2.imshow]
    ShowFrame --> CheckKey{Key pressed?}
    CheckKey -->|'q'| Quit[Quit]
    CheckKey -->|'p'| Pause[Pause]
    CheckKey -->|None| WriteFrame
    Pause --> WaitKey[Wait for key]
    WaitKey -->|'p'| FrameLoop
    WaitKey -->|'q'| Quit
    
    CheckDisplay -->|No| WriteFrame
    WriteFrame{Output path<br/>specified?}
    WriteFrame -->|Yes| Write[Write frame to<br/>output video]
    WriteFrame -->|No| NextFrame
    Write --> NextFrame[Increment<br/>frame_count]
    NextFrame --> FrameLoop
    
    EndLoop --> Cleanup[Cleanup]
    Quit --> Cleanup
    Cleanup --> ReleaseWriter[Release VideoWriter]
    ReleaseWriter --> CloseWindows[Close OpenCV windows]
    CloseWindows --> ReleaseCap[Release VideoCapture]
    ReleaseCap --> PrintStats[Print timing statistics]
    PrintStats --> End([End])
    
    Error1 --> End
    Error2 --> End
    Error3 --> End
    
    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style End fill:#FFB6C1
    style Error1 fill:#FF6B6B
    style Error2 fill:#FF6B6B
    style Error3 fill:#FF6B6B
    style Quit fill:#FFA500
